{"id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-isomorphism.md","title":"同构 ≅","display":"df-isomorphism — 同构 ≅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-isomorphism","aliases":["29-df-isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — 同构 ≅","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — 同构 ≅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\in \\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A, B \\in \\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f : |A| \\to |B|\">\\(f : |A| \\to |B|\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Surjective}\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}\">\\(\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}\\)</span> (defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash A \\cong B \\coloneqq \\exists f : |A| \\to |B| \\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f)\\land\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash A \\cong B \\coloneqq \\exists f : |A| \\to |B| \\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f)\\land\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,a&#39;\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Injective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,a&#39;\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=f(a&#39;)\\to a=a&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Surjective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Surjective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\mathrm{Injective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{Surjective}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\mathrm{Injective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{Surjective}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall i \\in \\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\forall e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\in |A| :\\; \\langle e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\rangle \\in R_i^A \\leftrightarrow \\langle f(e_1),\\ldots,f(e_{a_i}) \\rangle \\in R_i^B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall i \\in \\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\forall e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\in |A| :\\; \\langle e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\rangle \\in R_i^A \\leftrightarrow \\langle f(e_1),\\ldots,f(e_{a_i}) \\rangle \\in R_i^B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall j \\in \\{1,\\ldots,s\\} :\\; f(c_j^A) = c_j^B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall j \\in \\{1,\\ldots,s\\} :\\; f(c_j^A) = c_j^B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\coloneqq\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|A|^{r_k}\\;\\bigl(f(f_k^A(\\bar a))=f_k^B(f^{r_k}(\\bar a))\\bigr),\\qquad f^{r_k}(a_1,\\ldots,a_{r_k})\\coloneqq(f(a_1),\\ldots,f(a_{r_k}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\coloneqq\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|A|^{r_k}\\;\\bigl(f(f_k^A(\\bar a))=f_k^B(f^{r_k}(\\bar a))\\bigr),\\qquad f^{r_k}(a_1,\\ldots,a_{r_k})\\coloneqq(f(a_1),\\ldots,f(a_{r_k}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A, B \\in \\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-struc]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ (see [[29-df-vocab]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A, B \\in \\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau = \\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"f : |A| \\to |B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash A \\cong B \\coloneqq \\exists f : |A| \\to |B| \\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\land \\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f)\\land\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall a,a'\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=f(a')\\to a=a').","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Surjective}(f)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall b\\in|B|\\;\\exists a\\in|A|\\;(f(a)=b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\mathrm{Injective}(f) \\land \\mathrm{Surjective}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesRelations}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall i \\in \\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\forall e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\in |A| :\\; \\langle e_1,\\ldots,e_{a_i} \\rangle \\in R_i^A \\leftrightarrow \\langle f(e_1),\\ldots,f(e_{a_i}) \\rangle \\in R_i^B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesConstants}(f) \\;\\coloneqq\\; \\forall j \\in \\{1,\\ldots,s\\} :\\; f(c_j^A) = c_j^B","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreservesFunctions}(f)\\coloneqq\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,t\\}\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|A|^{r_k}\\;\\bigl(f(f_k^A(\\bar a))=f_k^B(f^{r_k}(\\bar a))\\bigr),\\qquad f^{r_k}(a_1,\\ldots,a_{r_k})\\coloneqq(f(a_1),\\ldots,f(a_{r_k}))","display":true}],"bytes":1847,"backlinks":[{"id":"688a1b544d81033c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇；$K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$I\\subseteq K$。$K$ 同构封闭，且 $\\forall A,B\\in K\\;(A\\cong B\\to(A\\in I\\leftrightarrow B\\in I))$；$\\cong$ 见 [[29-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"92256ad8556a5baf"